ifferent page flip sounds of Quran Majeed Pro - Holy Quran.\r\n\u2713 Quran mp3 and reading offline gives you a comfortable way to memories & read the Holy Quran. \r\n\u271315-line Quran Majeed: Al Quran Sharif is very useful for Muslims all over the world who read with Quran Majeed Pro - Holy Quran. \r\n\u2713 Quran Kareem is easy to use and  Quran 15 lines offline is specially designed for hafiz e Quran. \r\n\u2713 Quran mp3 and reading offline real Turning Page Effect like that real al Quran free with Quran Kareem audio. \r\n\u2713 Offline Quran recitation with real sound effects and 3D page flip animation.\r\n\u2713 Al Quran Sharif has the option for changing the colors of the text according to your choice. \r\n\u2713 Quran Majeed Pro - Holy Quran has the option to change the page background color for eye comfort easily.",
